SHORT DESCRIPTION (Nexus "Summary" field):
Pin items in your inventory so "Deposit All" skips them - toggle with P, plus a keyboard hotkey for Deposit All itself.

FULL DESCRIPTION (Nexus "Description" field, BBCode):
[color=#f6b26b][size=4][b]Description[/b][/size][/color]
[color=#D4D4D8]Tired of digging your tools, weapons and keepsakes back out of the chest after every "Deposit All"? This mod lets you pin items in the party inventory: hover an entry and press P, and the bulk deposit will leave it where it is. As a bonus, the game's Inventory button (E/B) runs Deposit All directly when a chest is open, so the whole routine works without the mouse.[/color]

[b][color=#f6b26b][size=4]Main features[/size][/color][/b]
[list]
[*][color=#D4D4D8]Pin/unpin any item with [b]P[/b] - works in the chest scene and in the regular item menu; pinned entries show a small "P" badge at the icon's top-left corner.[/color][/*]
[*][color=#D4D4D8][b]Deposit All skips pinned items[/b]; manual single deposits are unaffected.[/color][/*]
[*][color=#D4D4D8]Deposit All hotkey: with a chest open, the Inventory button ([b]E[/b]/[b]B[/b] by default, follows your Button Config binding) deposits everything unpinned.[/color][/*]
[*][color=#D4D4D8]Pins cover the whole stack of an item kind (items, weapons and armors tracked separately) and persist through save/load.[/color][/*]
[/list]
[color=#D4D4D8]What it does NOT do:[/color]

[list]
[*][color=#D4D4D8]No game files are edited. Disable the mod = 100% original game.[/color][/*]
[*][color=#D4D4D8]No balance or content changes - it only filters what "Deposit All" moves.[/color][/*]
[/list]

[b][color=#f6b26b][size=4]Installation instructions[/size][/color][/b]
[list=1]
[*][color=#D4D4D8]Extract the archive into your game folder so that the [i][font=Courier New]WTE_QOL_Deposit[/font][/i] folder ends up inside [i][font=Courier New]<game>\mods\[/font][/i].[/color][/*]
[*][color=#D4D4D8]Enable the mod loader (once per game install): open [i][font=Courier New]<game>\js\plugins.js[/font][/i] in any text editor, find [i][font=Courier New]"name":"VirtualModLoader","status":false[/font][/i] and change [i][font=Courier New]false[/font][/i] to [i][font=Courier New]true[/font][/i]. Save the file.[/color][/*]
[*][color=#D4D4D8]Launch the game - the loader rebuilds its injector and reloads once on first run. Done.[/color][/*]
[/list]
[quote][color=#D4D4D8]Note: game updates and Steam's "verify integrity of game files" restore the original [font=Courier New]js\plugins.js[/font] (loader off) and wipe the [font=Courier New]mods\[/font] folder - after each update repeat step 2 and re-drop the mod.[/color][/quote]

[b][color=#f6b26b][size=4]Uninstall[/size][/color][/b]
[color=#d4d4d8]Delete the [/color][i][font=Courier New][color=#d4d4d8]WTE_QOL_Deposit[/color][/font][/i][color=#d4d4d8] folder from [/color][i][font=Courier New][color=#d4d4d8]mods\[/color][/font][/i][color=#d4d4d8] (or rename it to [/color][i][font=Courier New][color=#d4d4d8]!WTE_QOL_Deposit[/color][/font][/i][color=#d4d4d8] to temporarily disable).[/color]

[b][color=#f6b26b][size=4]Configuration[/size][/color][/b]
[color=#D4D4D8]Settings live in the [font=Courier New]CONFIG[/font] object at the top of [i][font=Courier New]js\plugins\deposit_pins.js[/font][/i]: the pin key ([font=Courier New]PIN_KEY[/font], default P), the Deposit All hotkey button ([font=Courier New]DEPOSIT_KEY[/font], default the game's Inventory button) and a [font=Courier New]DEBUG[/font] flag for verbose logging.[/color]

[b][color=#f6b26b][size=4]Troubleshooting[/size][/color][/b]
[color=#D4D4D8]The mod always writes a log to [i][font=Courier New]mods\WTE_QOL_Deposit\logs\deposit_pins.log[/font][/i]. If anything misbehaves, attach that file to your bug report - it records the mod version, every pin/unpin, and any game errors.[/color]

[b][color=#f6b26b][size=4]Credits[/size][/color][/b]
[color=#D4D4D8]Made by Unvios.[/color]
